        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARLYOCOM, Carre Front Door Lock with Black Glass Lyon Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Carre Entryset with Lyon Knob features a solid forged brass rose that adds vintage beauty to the already stunning, vintage black glass Lyon knob. This entryset has a 5-pin Schlage C-keyway. The Carre Short Plate with Lyon Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack is a great choice for historic buildings. The single cylinder deadbolt offers security and the vintage allure offers style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Carre Plate with Lyon Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: 5-pin, C-keyway</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Carre Entrance Set with Lyon Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette and Deadbolt Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Black Glass</li>\r\n<li>Carre Plate Height: 4.75</li>\r\n<li>Carre Plate Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Lyon Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Lyon Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARLYO-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262385\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARLYO Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
