                "description": "The Carre Entryset with Lyon Knob features a solid forged brass rose that adds vintage beauty to the already stunning, vintage black glass Lyon knob. This entryset has a 5-pin Schlage C-keyway. The Carre Short Plate with Lyon Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack is a great choice for historic buildings. The single cylinder deadbolt offers security and the vintage allure offers style.",
